  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Kevin Lobo has been named among the top 50 chief executive officers for large companies in the 2019 Best CEO Awards list released by Comparably, a career data website. The awards are based on anonymized employee submissions and ratings over the last year on Comparably.com. Mr. Lobo ranks #8.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/news/best-ceos-2019/\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">View the list</span></a></p>\n<p>Interested in learning more?<br>\nIn addition to this recognition, Stryker has been named in the following award categories by Comparably in 2019:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/news/best-company-culture-2019/\">Best Company Culture&nbsp;</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/blog/best-work-life-balance-2019/\">Best Work-Life Balance&nbsp;</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/news/best-companies-for-women-2019/\">Best Companies for Women</a>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/blog/best-companies-for-perks-benefits-2019/\">Best Companies for Perks &amp; Benefits&nbsp;</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/blog/best-compensation-2019/\">Best Compensation</a>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/blog/happiest-employees-2019/\">Happiest Employees</a>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/blog/best-companies-for-professional-development-2019/\">Best Companies for Professional Development</a>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://www.comparably.com/blog/best-leadership-teams-2019/\">Best Leadership Teams</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Dec 12 2019 18:38:57 GMT+0000",
